WEBVTT

00:42:27.164 --> 00:42:30.113
or you're discussing some topic
that everyone's interested in.

00:42:30.137 --> 00:42:33.640
I love that, I feel safe in that,
I feel I can contribute.

00:42:33.664 --> 00:42:38.576
And Jacqueline, my wife, loves it as well.

00:42:38.600 --> 00:42:41.419
For me it's the negotiation
if you're married.

00:42:41.443 --> 00:42:43.765
If it's an introvert-extrovert couple,

00:42:43.789 --> 00:42:47.073
the negotiation isn't just about
how often to have a social event.

00:42:47.097 --> 00:42:49.084
It's probably about how many people come,

00:42:49.108 --> 00:42:51.315
and even more importantly,
what is the format?

00:42:51.339 --> 00:42:54.792
SC: Yes. Yeah, that's very true.
That's so, so true.

00:42:54.816 --> 00:43:00.435
The data that I looked at shows that
about half of couplings are a cross-type,